# =============================================================================
# Repository root `.env` (copy this file to `.env`; `.env` is gitignored)
# =============================================================================
# Sourced automatically by Bash scripts under `scripts/cloudflare/` when `.env`
# exists: deploy-admin-ui-preview.sh, deploy-admin-ui-production.sh,
# deploy-ezkey-org-preview.sh, deploy-ezkey-org-production.sh, and
# cleanup-ezkey-org-previews.sh (see docs/cloudflare/README.md).
#
# Use either `export KEY=value` or `KEY=value` per line (Bash `source` handles both).
#
# Create an API token: https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/api/get-started/create-token/
# Typical permissions: Account → Cloudflare Pages → Edit (or a custom template that includes
# Pages direct upload / project deploy for your account).
# Account ID: Cloudflare dashboard → account home / Workers & Pages overview (right-hand column).

# --- Required for all Wrangler Pages deploys ---
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# --- Optional: Pages project overrides (defaults shown) ---
# Admin UI direct uploads:
# CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT=ezkey-admin-ui
# Production branch must match the Pages project setting (often main):
# CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PRODUCTION_BRANCH=main
#
# Marketing site (ezkey.org):
# CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT=ezkey-org
#
# Preview scripts only: fixed preview branch name instead of timestamped default:
# PREVIEW_BRANCH=my-feature

# --- Admin UI: Vite env when using deploy-*-admin-ui-*.sh --build ---
# Public origin of the Admin API (embedded in the SPA at build time).
# If unset, deploy scripts default to https://exp1-admin-api.ezkey.org
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://exp1-admin-api.ezkey.org

# When the Admin API uses browser HttpOnly session cookies, set this to match the API
# (EZKEY_ADMIN_AUTH_BROWSER_SESSION_COOKIE_ENABLED). Committed reference: ezkey-admin-ui/.env.cloudflare
# VITE_ADMIN_AUTH_USE_HTTP_ONLY_SESSION_COOKIE=true

# Optional: only if you changed CSRF cookie/header names on the API
# VITE_ADMIN_AUTH_CSRF_COOKIE_NAME=EZKEY_ADMIN_CSRF
# VITE_ADMIN_AUTH_CSRF_HEADER_NAME=X-CSRF-TOKEN

# Optional: Wrangler --commit-message for deploy scripts
# DEPLOY_COMMIT_MSG=manual deploy
